<Layout title="About JotColoring"><Header/><main id="main" class="text-page"><h1>A little time for color.</h1><p>JotColoring brings together printable black-and-white drawings and a browser coloring studio. Choose a page, print it, or add your own colors on your device.</p><h2>Your artwork stays yours to explore</h2><p>Studio projects and favorites are saved in this browser on this device. They are not automatically uploaded or synced. Download a finished picture before clearing browser storage.</p><h2>About the collection</h2><p>The initial collection contains original AI-assisted illustrations prepared for JotColoring. Downloadable outlines remain black and white. Colored examples on the home page show possible color choices.</p><a href="/coloring-pages/" class="button primary">Find your next page →</a></main></Layout>
